---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Agricultural Finance, Grants & Machinery Resources | GoOrganicAfrica
description: Find structured agricultural finance, grants, machinery, equipment and marketplace resources for African farmers and agribusinesses.
permalink: "/agriculture-resources/"
---
{% set listings = directoryListings.listings | default([]) %}
{% set finance_count = listings | selectattr("type","equalto","finance") | selectattr("active","equalto",true) | list | length %}
{% set machinery_count = listings | selectattr("type","equalto","equipment") | selectattr("active","equalto",true) | list | length %}
{% set grant_count = agriculturalGrants.opportunities | default([]) | selectattr("active","equalto",true) | list | length %}
<section class="section" style="padding-top:48px;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:1000px;">
    <span class="eyebrow">Farmer Resources</span>
    <h1>Agricultural Finance, Grants & Machinery</h1>
    <p class="lede">A structured resource centre for finding agricultural funding, grant opportunities, machinery, equipment and related services. Listings are maintained through the GoOrganicAfrica CMS and displayed with verification information.</p>

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:26px;">
      <div style="padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;"><strong>{{ finance_count }}</strong><br>finance listings</div>
      <div style="padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;"><strong>{{ grant_count }}</strong><br>grant/opportunity listings</div>
      <div style="padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;"><strong>{{ machinery_count }}</strong><br>machinery listings</div>
      <div style="padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;"><strong>54</strong><br>African countries in scope</div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:32px;">
      <a class="ebook-card" href="/agricultural-finance/" style="text-decoration:none;"><h2>Agricultural Finance</h2><p>Loans, insurance, input finance, equipment finance, leasing and other agricultural funding routes.</p><strong>Search finance →</strong></a>
      <a class="ebook-card" href="/agricultural-grants/" style="text-decoration:none;"><h2>Grants & Opportunities</h2><p>Grants, subsidies, competitions, youth and women programmes, training and other opportunities.</p><strong>Search opportunities →</strong></a>
      <a class="ebook-card" href="/farm-machinery/" style="text-decoration:none;"><h2>Farm Machinery</h2><p>Tractors, planters, harvesters, irrigation, processing, greenhouse and other farm equipment.</p><strong>Search machinery →</strong></a>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:36px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;">
      <h2>Verification matters</h2>
      <p>Funding and equipment offers can change, close or have eligibility restrictions. GoOrganicAfrica publishes directory records from identifiable sources and shows the verification status and last-verified date when available. Official-source links are provided so users can confirm current terms before applying or purchasing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>